{"id":"626454","name":"香炸荞叶粄","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/626454/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"荞叶","amount":"150g"},{"name":"糯米粉","amount":"200g"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"150g"}],"sub":[{"name":"五香粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"荞头。","img":"images/626454/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"清洗干净后，去掉头部，只取叶子部分。","img":"images/626454/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"荞叶切成碎粒。","img":"images/626454/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"准备面粉和糯米粉。","img":"images/626454/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"把面粉和糯米粉倒入荞叶盆中，加入适量的糖、盐、五香粉调味。","img":"images/626454/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入适量的清水，搓成面团。","img":"images/626454/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"取一块面剂，按成饼状。","img":"images/626454/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"油温五成热下锅炸，全程用小火。","img":"images/626454/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"定型后翻个面。","img":"images/626454/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"不停翻面。","img":"images/626454/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"炸至金黄酥脆捞起。","img":"images/626454/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"非常的酥脆，荞叶的味道格外香。","img":"images/626454/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}